# VHS neon: species-ID diameter(m) omega tref(K) alpha.
# Bird, "Molecular Gas Dynamics and the Direct Simulation of Gas Flows"
# (1994), Table A1 -- standard DSMC reference values (temperature-dependent
# viscosity, unlike he.species/he.vss's simplified hard-sphere He model).
# Diameter re-derived from Table A1's own mass/viscosity/omega via
# mu_ref = 15*sqrt(pi*m*kB*Tref) / (2*pi*d^2*(5-2*omega)*(7-2*omega));
# corrects a prior transcription (2.79e-10) -- see
# docs/fluor-cell-3d-code-review-findings.md.

Ne  2.766e-10  0.66  273.15  1.0
